The apartment is located on Banacha Street in the Prądnik Biały district of Kraków, in a new seven-story building completed in 2025, situated on the 4nd floor.
In the immediate vicinity: O3 Business Campus, Opolska Street, Plac Imbramowski, Serenada Shopping Center, Multikino, Aqua Park, grocery stores, cafés, restaurants, and a well-developed commercial and service infrastructure, as well as corporate offices.
